Speaker embedding model
-----------------------
Thymbre downloads a pretrained speaker embedding model at runtime and does not
redistribute its weights. The model is provided by SpeechBrain and was trained
on VoxCeleb. Check the model card and the VoxCeleb terms before using Thymbre
in a commercial product.

Third-party software
--------------------
Thymbre depends on open source packages (FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, Alembic, pgvector,
SpeechBrain and others), each under its own license.

